# ALLIANCE. New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/alcaz-prison and quest pages (level range is Blizzard's).
@dungeon Alcaz Prison
@levels 48-53
@window 46-54
@best 49
@hub Dustwallow Marsh, 66.0, 49.0, 8
@hub Tanaris, 51.6, 27.0, 5
@hub Stormwind City, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is on Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of Dustwallow Marsh, a short swim from Theramore. Sully McCleary in Theramore (Dustwallow Marsh 66.2, 45.2) gives A Bit of Wet Work, and Somber News is handed in to him. Archmage Lan'dalock in Dalaran (Alterac Mountains 15.9, 73.1) gives The Dragon's Journal. The Secret Prison comes at the end of a chain that starts with Our Man in Theramore. A prisoner inside gives The Man in the Iron Chains and then More Valuable Than Gold, which ends at Connery's Trunk in Westfall (43.4, 67.8). Take what is offered: the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
